**データモデル案**
```ts
type MetricStat = {
  value?: number;
  avg?: number;
  min?: number;
  max?: number;
  count?: number;
};

type MetricValue = number | string | boolean | null | MetricStat;

type StreamState = {
  streamKey: string;
  kind: string;          // "RTP", "SRT", "ICMP", "TCP", "UDP" etc.
  proto: string;
  endpointA?: string;
  endpointB?: string;
  sessionDst?: string;
  streamId?: string;
  active: boolean;
  lastSeen: number;

  flowCount: number;
  flowRoles: string[];

  bitrate: MetricStat;   // stream集約bitrate only
  sparkline: number[];

  flows: FlowState[];
};

type FlowState = {
  flowKey: string;
  role: string;          // media, fec_row, fec_col, default, direction, etc.
  endpointSrc?: string;
  endpointDst?: string;
  lastSeen?: number;

  metrics: Record<string, MetricValue>;
};
```

**メトリクスの正規化**
プロトコルごとに表示を決め打ちせず、ログに存在するメトリクスを flatten して descriptor を生成します。

